Paretly is a modified version of Squirrel (鼠须管 / 鼠鬚管), the macOS
frontend of the Rime input method engine, published by the Rime
developers (式恕堂). The base is Squirrel 1.1.2, commit
876adebaf2f612951dcdca8a591de65401222b9a. Modifications in this
repository, dated 2026, include the product name Paretly, the default
schema Rime ICE (雾凇拼音), an unsigned disk image, and a native
settings window. Copyright notices that came with the upstream source
are kept.

